    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: Comedy Romance <strong>Visual Novel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Around 4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number of Non-Variant CGs</strong>: About 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Route, Single Playthrough, Single Ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy Ending , Pure Love Story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/9658251b94cbeaf954e77b810ec7b8f4.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;The same view can feel entirely different when shared with someone</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u2014have you ever noticed that?&quot; \u2014\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Vanessa Chen</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/6370fb96f6785949f7bbe122b6f3af13.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Has your day-after-day existence ever given you that irreplaceable sense of being alive?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If not, then perhaps reality is just a shoddily rendered dream.&quot;\u00a0\u2014\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Ivy Xu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/2dc4c56c0ca57aea8eb0b13e552bb612.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;The Slicing Project shall stand as the final archive of human civilization\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>and I will have it be true. Then, and only then, flawless.&quot; \u2014\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Gipo Cardon</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/eabb4e71126e456812825f80df3d4104.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/77da2ba9419f4b7b66e251218bf64ea9.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/2101569a78e68e529bbb372201f1f4bf.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: Comedy Romance <strong>Visual Novel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Around 4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number of Non-Variant CGs</strong>: About 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Route, Single Playthrough, Single Ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy Ending , Pure Love Story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/9658251b94cbeaf954e77b810ec7b8f4.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;The same view can feel entirely different when shared with someone</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u2014have you ever noticed that?&quot; \u2014\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Vanessa Chen</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/6370fb96f6785949f7bbe122b6f3af13.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Has your day-after-day existence ever given you that irreplaceable sense of being alive?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If not, then perhaps reality is just a shoddily rendered dream.&quot;\u00a0\u2014\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Ivy Xu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/2dc4c56c0ca57aea8eb0b13e552bb612.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;The Slicing Project shall stand as the final archive of human civilization\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>and I will have it be true. Then, and only then, flawless.&quot; \u2014\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Gipo Cardon</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/eabb4e71126e456812825f80df3d4104.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/77da2ba9419f4b7b66e251218bf64ea9.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872710/extras/2101569a78e68e529bbb372201f1f4bf.avif?t=1754552120\" width=800 height=1172 /></span></p>",
